WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.390
Kumayri, today's Gyumri,
was an old village

2
00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:09.391
on the plain of Shirak,
beneath Mount Aragats.

3
00:00:09.431 --> 00:00:12.041
In the sixteenth century
the highlands became

4
00:00:12.081 --> 00:00:16.361
the battlefield of two empires,
Ottoman and Safavid.

5
00:00:16.401 --> 00:00:21.576
In 1555 the Peace of Amasya
split Armenia between them.

6
00:00:21.936 --> 00:00:25.311
In 1578 the war began again.

7
00:00:25.351 --> 00:00:29.601
In 1579 the Ottoman commander
Lala Mustafa Pasha

8
00:00:29.641 --> 00:00:32.974
refortified Kars, west of Kumayri.

9
00:00:33.014 --> 00:00:36.218
That October,
Ottoman raiders struck Erivan.

10
00:00:36.578 --> 00:00:40.148
No fighting at Kumayri itself
is recorded that year,

11
00:00:40.188 --> 00:00:42.759
but the war stood
on both sides of it.

12
00:00:42.799 --> 00:00:46.823
For Shirak, it meant
armies on the road, again and again.

13
00:00:47.183 --> 00:00:53.113
From 1604 Shah Abbas deported
whole Armenian communities to Persia,

14
00:00:53.153 --> 00:00:56.071
and Shirak was among
the lands emptied.

15
00:00:56.431 --> 00:00:58.810
Hold the winter road.

